@startuml
node "Dispositivo do Usuário" {
  component "Navegador Web\n(Browser)" as Browser
}

cloud "Vercel" {
  node "Frontend Server" {
    component "React SPA\n(Worky UI)" as ReactUI
  }
}

cloud "Servidor Backend" {
  node "Backend" {
    component "FastAPI App" as FastAPI
    component "JobScraper\n(httpx + BeautifulSoup)" as Scraper
    component "CourseCatalog\n(scraping de cursos)" as Courses
  }
}

cloud "OpenAI" {
  component "API GPT-4o mini" as OpenAIAPI
}

cloud "Supabase Cloud" {
  database "PostgreSQL" as PG
  component "Auth Service" as Auth
}

Browser <--> ReactUI : HTTPS
ReactUI <--> FastAPI : API REST (JSON)
ReactUI <--> Auth : JWT Auth
FastAPI --> Scraper : Executa
FastAPI --> Courses : Executa
FastAPI <--> OpenAIAPI : HTTPS (análise de carreira)
FastAPI <--> PG : Leitura/Escrita (cache e perfis)
@enduml
